   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "8K: 65,536 B x 8192 = 536,870,912 B = 0.54 GB\n4K: 65,536 B x 4096 = 268,435,456 B = 0.27 GB\nConcurrency is capped by VRAM, long context\nkills it: 100K -> 3 users, 4K -> 82 users.",
   "originalText": "8K: 65,536 B x 8192 = 536,870,912 B = 0.54 GB\n4K: 65,536 B x 4096 = 268,435,456 B = 0.27 GB\nConcurrency is capped by VRAM, long context\nkills it: 100K -> 3 users, 4K -> 82 users.",
