   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Do not confuse 40 GB with 40 GB/s\nor with TFLOPS.\n\nCapacity: how much I can keep resident.\nBandwidth: how fast I can move it.\nThroughput: how fast I can multiply\nonce data arrives.",
   "originalText": "Do not confuse 40 GB with 40 GB/s\nor with TFLOPS.\n\nCapacity: how much I can keep resident.\nBandwidth: how fast I can move it.\nThroughput: how fast I can multiply\nonce data arrives.",
