   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "DECODE TPOT FLOOR (B=1, GQA-8, T=100K)\nbytes per token ~ weights 14 GB + KV 6.55 GB = 20.55 GB\n20.55 GB / 1,555 GB/s = 13.2 ms  (~76 tokens/s)\n  weights alone: 14 / 1555 = 9.0 ms\n  KV alone:      6.55 / 1555 = 4.2 ms\nMHA: 40.2 GB / 1555 = 25.9 ms (~39 tok/s, but OOM)",
   "originalText": "DECODE TPOT FLOOR (B=1, GQA-8, T=100K)\nbytes per token ~ weights 14 GB + KV 6.55 GB = 20.55 GB\n20.55 GB / 1,555 GB/s = 13.2 ms  (~76 tokens/s)\n  weights alone: 14 / 1555 = 9.0 ms\n  KV alone:      6.55 / 1555 = 4.2 ms\nMHA: 40.2 GB / 1555 = 25.9 ms (~39 tok/s, but OOM)",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e328",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
