   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Weights set the baseline footprint; KV sets how it grows with context and concurrency.\nGQA/MLA shrink KV; HBM bandwidth feeds the cores; Tensor Cores do the math.\nLatency is whichever of memory movement or arithmetic reaches its roof first.",
   "originalText": "Weights set the baseline footprint; KV sets how it grows with context and concurrency.\nGQA/MLA shrink KV; HBM bandwidth feeds the cores; Tensor Cores do the math.\nLatency is whichever of memory movement or arithmetic reaches its roof first.",
